---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Resources"
  description="Bylaws, branding, and the assistants published by Rotaract Europe."
>
  <main id="content" class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="kicker">Resources</p>
      <h1>Documents clubs ask for</h1>
      <p>
        The files themselves are still on the current site. Copying the PDFs into this repository is a separate commit, so the links below go to the pages that host them today.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <article class="panel">
        <h2>Bylaws and the MDIO guide</h2>
        <p>The statute, the code of policies, and the note on how a multi-district information organisation is built.</p>
        <a href="https://rotaracteurope.eu/resources/">Open resources on the current site</a>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <h2>Brand</h2>
        <p>The Rotary brand centre, the compliant logo, and the do’s and don’ts for Rotaract marks.</p>
        <a href="https://rotaracteurope.eu/resources/">Open the brand links</a>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <h2>Three assistants</h2>
        <p>One answers from the statute, one from the event checklist, and one helps draft a bylaw proposal. They stay on the current site until the committee decides where they should live.</p>
        <a href="https://rotaracteurope.eu/resources/">Open the assistants</a>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <h2>History</h2>
        <p>Past boards and past country representatives are long pages on the current site. They belong in the archive import, not retyped here.</p>
        <a href="https://rotaracteurope.eu/history-boards/">Past boards</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
